-- expect-refusal: quantile's percent is an integer or a variable bound before it
-- examples/checks/agg-holistic-safety-8-refused-percent-inside.rofl — a
-- percent the body binds would be a percent per member.
ahs_qin(G, Q) :- ahs_group(G), Q is quantile(P, V ; K : ahs_line(G, K, V), ahs_ask(G, P)).
